### T-06 — ресурс не знайдено 
GET {{api}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### CP-01 — overposting
POST {{api}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Overposting probe",
  "description": "Перевірка зайвих полів у запиті.",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-08-03T10:00:00Z",
  "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "ownerUserId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "status": "Closed"
}

